<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [1400].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>1400&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SULFURIMONAS MEDIUM WITH SULFUR</FONT></B></P>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> CaCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;2H<sub>2</sub>O  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.1 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NH<sub>4</sub>Cl  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.1 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> KH<sub>2</sub>PO<sub>4</sub>  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.1 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> KCl  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.1 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> MgSO<sub>4</sub>&#183;7H<sub>2</sub>O  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.5 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NaNO<sub>3</sub>  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.85 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Na<sub>2</sub>S<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub>&#183;5H<sub>2</sub>O  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.1 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Trace element solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=439">439</a>)  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Selenite tungstate solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=431">431</a>)  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Sulfur (powder)  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.5 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;970.0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Mix components thoroughly, except sulfur, and autoclave under a N<sub>2</sub>-CO<sub>2</sub> (4:1, v/v) gas atmosphere. After cooling, add the following solutions from anaerobic stocks (autoclaved or *filter-sterilized): <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 8% NaHCO<sub>3</sub> solution*  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;30.0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Vitamin solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=403">403</a>)*  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Thiamine solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=403">403</a>)*  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Vitamin B<sub>12</sub> solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=403">403</a>)*  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Steam sulfur for 3 hr on each of 3 successive days. Aseptically and anaerobically, distribute the medium into culture vessels containing appropriate amount of sulfur under the same gas mixture (e.g., 20 ml in 60 ml-serum bottles containing 0.05 g sulfur) and seal with butyl rubber stoppers.       <br>
